record.content:
The axis angle of rotation is a result of Euler's theorem of rotation and it describes a rotation of a three dimensional rigid body by a unit vector
\begin{equation}
\hat{e} = \left[ \begin{array}{c}
e_1 \\
e_2 \\
e_3 \end{array} \right]
\end{equation}

and an angle of rotation, $ \alpha $.
